<report>
<title>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (Dwass-Steel-Chritchlow-Fligner)</title>
<p>Critical q (range) = @{q:roundu}</p>
<block name="dwass">
<br />
<table>
<tr><td>@compare</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>
<tr><td>(@val)</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
<br />

<p>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (Conover-Iman)<br />
Critical t (@df df) = @{t:roundu}</p>
<block name="conover">
<br />
<table>
<tr><td>@compare</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>
<tr><td>(@val)</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
</report>
